==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 44.67~46.67 seconds<sup>1,340f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]/[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]/[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] are all particularly effective at taking down J.K. Bun Bun. Additionally, [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] is powerful enough to hold back the Dark Otters and Doge Darks by himself, and [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] can stall the boss really well.

